<title>USA: India buys 18,000T US sunflowerseed oil - exporters.</title>
<headline>India buys 18,000T US sunflowerseed oil - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>India recently bought 18,000 tonnes of U.S. sunflowerseed oil for December shipment from the Gulf of Mexico, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a done deal,&quot; a vegetable oil exporter said.</p>
<p>Although the price of the purchase could not be confirmed, there was talk that the sunflowerseed oil was bought for 0.10 cent per lb under CBOT December soybean oil futures, sources said.</p>
<p>--Anna Driver 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
